@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Activity Diagram 1 - Upload Evidence
|Investigator|
start
:Open case page;
:Choose file and enter description;
:Click "Upload and hash";
|System|
if (User logged in and allowed to upload to this case?) then (no)
  :Show "403 Forbidden";
  stop
endif
if (Case status = Open?) then (no)
  :Show "Case is closed";
  stop
endif
if (File chosen and not empty?) then (no)
  :Show validation error;
  |Investigator|
  :Choose a valid file;
  stop
endif
|System|
:Read file in 64 KB chunks;
fork
  :Write chunk to evidence store;
fork again
  :Update SHA-256 digest;
end fork
:Set stored file read-only;
:Create Evidence record\n(code, size, SHA-256, custodian);
:Append UPLOAD event to hash-chained log;
:Run anomaly rules on event;
|Investigator|
:See evidence page with SHA-256 hash;
stop
@enduml
